{"unit_id":"nubeslove__dsh-grillme#card-zh","repo":"nubeslove/dsh-grillme","commit":"0c48c7ae3dbf69440a2e86328b245b8e5fb1adc7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-grillme 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的提问等级插件，在输入框底部添加选择按钮，并将当前等级作为系统提示词 section 注入对话。用户可在关闭、L1 至 L5 六档之间选择，控制 AI 自主决策、先报告计划或逐步询问的方式；档位按会话保存，也可查看将注入的指令。它适合希望调整 DSH 对话中提问频率和决策参与程度的用户。插件使用本地 DSH 配置目录保存状态，需要 DSH_HOME（未设置时使用 ~/.dsh），不需额外 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:324-336","lib/index.js:433-475"]}
{"unit_id":"nubeslove__dsh-grillme#card-en","repo":"nubeslove/dsh-grillme","commit":"0c48c7ae3dbf69440a2e86328b245b8e5fb1adc7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-grillme adds a question-level selector to the DSH web input and injects its directive into the system prompt. Choose off or L1–L5 to tune assistant decisions and questions per conversation, and preview the directive. State is stored locally under DSH_HOME or ~/.dsh; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:324-336","lib/index.js:433-475"]}
